        "name": "[Brassy Bangers Pack] Michael-Leon Wooley - When We're Human (from \"The Princess and the Frog\")",
        "description": "Expert+ is a bit more experimental than my usual stuff, if you're looking for my normal mapping style try play the Expert diff.\r\n\r\nThis map is for @JLCmapping's \"Big Band Brassy Bangers Pack,\" hosted by me.\r\n\r\nI felt that Beatsaber was severely lacking maps that feature brass instruments, so I thought what better pack to organise than one to celebrate songs that heavily feature brass instruments. \r\n\r\nCheck out the Big Band Brassy Bangers Pack here: https://beatsaver.com/playlists/360370",
