        "id": "3e1ed",
        "name": "[Electro Swing World Tour Pack] [Chroma] KANKAN - Bloody Mary",
        "description": "Might have gone a little overboard on the techyness in Ex+ for the pack, woops...\nPlease install the Chroma mod for the full experience!\n\nPart of the Electro Swing Pack Vol. 5: World Tour!\nDownload it here:\nhttps://beatsaver.com/playlists/588497\n\nThe pack features 11 electro swing songs in various different languages from all across the globe. \nEach culture imparts a unique charm to the sound, so let's get absorbed into the music and travel the world with electro swing!\n\nThanks to @Kassi and HitmeWMusic for playtesting and @Tsunami_Pro for helping with the lights, much obliged!\n\nTo be completed...?",
